{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"pages":{"94589231":{"pageid":94589231,"ns":6,"title":"File:AMC Safe & Clean at concessions sign in AMC Sundial 12 movie theater, St. Petersburg, Florida, Sep 2020.jpg","index":2,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":5072009,"width":2340,"height":4160,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/AMC_Safe_%26_Clean_at_concessions_sign_in_AMC_Sundial_12_movie_theater%2C_St._Petersburg%2C_Florida%2C_Sep_2020.jpg/960px-AMC_Safe_%26_Clean_at_concessions_sign_in_AMC_Sundial_12_movie_theater%2C_St._Petersburg%2C_Florida%2C_Sep_2020.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":1138,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/AMC_Safe_%26_Clean_at_concessions_sign_in_AMC_Sundial_12_movie_theater%2C_St._Petersburg%2C_Florida%2C_Sep_2020.jpg/1280px-AMC_Safe_%26_Clean_at_concessions_sign_in_AMC_Sundial_12_movie_theater%2C_St._Petersburg%2C_Florida%2C_Sep_2020.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/AMC_Safe_%26_Clean_at_concessions_sign_in_AMC_Sundial_12_movie_theater%2C_St._Petersburg%2C_Florida%2C_Sep_2020.jpg/960px-AMC_Safe_%26_Clean_at_concessions_sign_in_AMC_Sundial_12_movie_theater%2C_St._Petersburg%2C_Florida%2C_Sep_2020.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":1138,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/AMC_Safe_%26_Clean_at_concessions_sign_in_AMC_Sundial_12_movie_theater%2C_St._Petersburg%2C_Florida%2C_Sep_2020.jpg/1280px-AMC_Safe_%26_Clean_at_concessions_sign_in_AMC_Sundial_12_movie_theater%2C_St._Petersburg%2C_Florida%2C_Sep_2020.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/AMC_Safe_%26_Clean_at_concessions_sign_in_AMC_Sundial_12_movie_theater%2C_St._Petersburg%2C_Florida%2C_Sep_2020.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:AMC_Safe_%26_Clean_at_concessions_sign_in_AMC_Sundial_12_movie_theater,_St._Petersburg,_Florida,_Sep_2020.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=94589231","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"A sign inside AMC Sundial 12, a movie theatre in St. Petersburg, Florida. The top of the sign reads \"AMC Safe &amp; Clean AT CONCESSIONS\" in white text on a red background, followed by the text: \"Our menu is temporarily simplified for shorter lines and quicker service. Throughout the day, our crew will routinely clean high touch points.\" Next to this statement is the text \"Advised by CLOROX Cleaning Advisor\".\n<p>Much of the sign is taken up by six icons with descriptions. The first icon features a representation of a hand holding a card in a machine, accompanied by the text \"Cash Not Accepted\" and \"If needed, use cash where tickets are sold to buy an AMC gift card. Cash is not accepted at concessions or MacGuffins\u00ae Bar to avoid shared contact with food handling.\" The icon to its right is paired with the text \"Ask for Condiments, Napkins &amp; More\": \"To reduce touch points, napkins, lids, straws and condiments like ketchup, mustard, relish, buttery popcorn topping and salt are available by request.\" The icon in the top right features an \"X\" overlayed on symbols represented popcorn and soda, with the text \"Refills Temporarily Unavailable\": \"To minimize contact, popcorn and Coca-Cola\u00ae Freestyle drink refills are unavailable at this time.\"\n</p><p>The next three icons are as follows: a hand with a wipe, with the text \"Hand Sanitizer &amp; Disinfecting Wipes Available\" and \"Take advantage of the sanitizer and wipe stations at concessions, especially before and after pouring your favorite Coca-Cola\u00ae Freestyle drink.\"; a vacuum, with the text \"HEPA Vacuum Filters\" and \"Every night, we vacuum carpeted areas using vacuums with HEPA filters, which are proven to trap 99.97% of airborne particles.\"; and a person wearing a face mask, with the text \"Masks Required For All\" and \"Protect yourself and others by wearing a mask, available for purchase if needed. In the auditorium, masks are still required, but may be removed while enjoying food and drinks.\"\n</p>\nThe lower half of the sign features the text \"Learn More at AMCTheatres.com/AMCSafeAndClean\", followed by the AMC logo with the text \"Safe &amp; Clean\u2122\". Below that is the text \"Learn More at AMCTheatres.com\", some small print, and \"Clorox is not an exclusive supplier of AMC.\"","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"Taken on\u00a025 September 2020, 09:38:53","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:MatthewHoobin\" title=\"User:MatthewHoobin\">MatthewHoobin</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"92161883":{"pageid":92161883,"ns":6,"title":"File:Agricultural trade highlights (IA CAT10401061048).pdf","index":7,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":2156899,"width":1220,"height":1600,"pagecount":20,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Agricultural_trade_highlights_%28IA_CAT10401061048%29.pdf/page1-960px-Agricultural_trade_highlights_%28IA_CAT10401061048%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":839,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Agricultural_trade_highlights_%28IA_CAT10401061048%29.pdf/page1-960px-Agricultural_trade_highlights_%28IA_CAT10401061048%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo